                "Transester TX-2 at Dimcarb-Twine DT-5 is already 81.2 C, 5.2 K past the "
                "76.0 C methanolate cap, yet feed still offers 14.2 t/h as if the bed were cool. "
                "A bed sample that lands first should clamp methanolate; a feed sample that lands "
                "first would hold cruise. Packed-bed AE stays silent until the later slump.",